                                                   Text="Before a Lost Ark update, restore every installed Arkive mod. Afterwards, run this full check once: Arkive scans every modified UPK and retained deployment target, validates the Western package/protection profile, decodes every compressed chunk, and compares every checked texture and mesh export. No game file is changed by checking or rebasing." />
